8. Executable & Install Paths

# Path of current Python executable
print(sys.executable)
# Output: /usr/bin/python3

# Python installation prefix
print(sys.prefix)
# Output: /usr

# Path of currently running script
print(sys.argv[0])
# Output: deploy.py

Real DevOps Use:

# Use same Python that's running the script
import subprocess
subprocess.run([sys.executable, 'another_script.py'])
